# FocusAI - AI Productivity App

## 📌 Problem

People struggle to manage daily tasks and stay productive.

## 💡 Solution

FocusAI is an AI-powered productivity app that helps users optimize their day and focus better.

## 🚀 Features

* Task Management
* AI Suggestions
* Focus Mode

